OL,3,GNEWSAFamily tribute to 'beautiful soul'
OL,4,Akilled in multi-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman who was killed in
OL,7,Fa four-car crash near Edinburgh Airport
OL,8,Fhave described her as a "beautiful
OL,9,Fsoul".
OL,11,FLinda Patterson, 58, was driving a
OL,12,FHyundai i30 when the collision happened
OL,13,Fon the A8, near Newbridge, on Monday.
OL,14,FShe was pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,16,FShola Richards, 32, has since been
OL,17,Fcharged with offences including causing
OL,18,Fdeath by dangerous driving and
OL,19,Fattempting to pervert the course of
OL,20,Fjustice.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
