OL,4,Akilled in multi-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichards, of Broxburn, West Lothian,
OL,7,Fwas also charged with failing to stop
OL,8,Fafter the incident and failing to
OL,9,Fprovide driver's details to police.
